title: Judiciary Reform
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: dvp_in_government = 1 and justice_minister_party = dvp_name and judiciary_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; judiciary_timer += 6
card-image: img/portraits/RadbruchGustav.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Judiciary Reform

[? if judiciary_reform < 4: The Judiciary is one of the most reactionary components of the government, along with the military. Many jurists have held office since the days of the Emperor. ?]
[? if judiciary_reform >= 4: The Judiciary has been reformed to better suit a democratic republic. ?]

- @reform: Carry out substantial judicial reforms.
- @minor_reforms: Carry out minor judicial reforms.
- @as_is: Leave the judiciary as it is.
- @corrupt: Corrupt the judiciary.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@reform
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
view-if: dvp_ideology = "Left"
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; democratization += 2; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition == 1; new_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 2; pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); coup_progress += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if historical_mode; hindenburg_angry += 5;

We investigate jurists who have shown themselves to have biased or corrupt behavior, and try to remove them, replacing them with more independent jurists. This obviously raises quite a great deal of ire in opposition circles. 

@minor_reforms
view-if: dvp_ideology = "Left"
on-arrival: democratization += 1; new_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); judiciary_timer += 6

We try to remove the most obviously biased and corrupt jurists, while leaving most of the system intact. It is slow work reforming the judiciary.

@as_is
go-to: root

@corrupt
view-if: dvp_ideology = "Right"
on-arrival: democratization -= 2; judicial_reform -= 2; pro_republic -= 3*(1-dissent); judiciary_timer += 6; spd_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 5;

We have corrupted the judiciary, removing the more independent judges and supporting biased reactionaries. This obviously raises quite a great deal of ire in opposition circles.
